  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture LWF Tuzla-00</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jordbruksst&#xF6;d LWF Tuzla</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural support to refugees and returnees in Bosnia through LWF Tuzla. The project aim is to strengthen the returnees&apos; capacity to become self-supporting (vegetables, meat, dairy products etc) and to develop a comercially sustainable agricultural production. The counterpart is the Lutheran World Federation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Jordbruksst&#xF6;d till flyktingar och &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndande i Bosnien genom LWF Tuzla. Projektm&#xE5;l &#xE4;r att de &#xE5;terv&#xE4;ndande skall bli sj&#xE4;lvf&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjande g&#xE4;llande gr&#xF6;nsaker/k&#xF6;tt, mj&#xF6;lkprodukter etc och efter f&#xF6;rm&#xE5;ga kunna bibringas inkomster genom komersiellt l&#xF6;nsam jordbruksproduktion. Samarbetspart &#xE4;r The Lutheran World Federation.</narrative>
  </description>
